# Mizugame25

ZMK firmware for the Mizugame25 macro pad.

Hardware baseline:
- Seeed Studio XIAO nRF52840
- 4 x 5 key matrix (20 key positions)
- EC12/EC11-compatible rotary encoder with push switch
- Five side tactile switches

Current firmware stage:
- Basic drawing keymap
- Direct Shift / GUI / Alt / Space hold behavior
- Side-key shortcuts
- Encoder mapped to [ and ]
- Combos and additional layers to be added later
